  <reporting-org ref="XI-IATI-IADB" type="40">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Inter-American Development Bank</narrative>
  </reporting-org>
  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">Programa de Turismo Sostenible</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Sustainable Tourism Program</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">Aumentar la contribucin del turismo al crecimiento econmico nacional de una manera ambiental y socialmente responsable. Su propsito es apoyar la consolidacin del mercado turstico de pernoctacin a la luz de su potencial para optimizar la contribucin del sector a la economa belicena. Sus objetivos son los siguientes: (a) apoyar la mejora, restauracin y diversificacin de los destinos de pernoctacin y sus productos; y (b) fortalecer la capacidad nacional y local en materia de poltica sectorial y planificacin y gestin de destinos.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">To increase the contribution of tourism to national economic growth in a manner that is environmentally and socially responsible. Its purpose is to support the consolidation of the overnight tourism market in light of its potential to optimize the sector&apos;s contribution to the Belizean economy. its objectives are to: (a) support the improvement, restoration and diversification of overnight destinations and their products; and (b) strengthen national and local capacity for sector policy, destination planning and management.</narrative>
  </description>
